			"notes": "<img width=\"801\" height=\"659\" alt=\"grafik\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1b95b7c8-6382-48d1-b58a-66ef3e6b74f8\" />\n\n\n## 📑 Changes\n- BlockModel can now be changed with asset pack\n- Added new blocks:\n  - Star Lamp\n  - Star Lantern\n  - Moonsteel Bricks\n  - Moonsteel Bricks Slabs\n  - Moonsteel Bricks Stairs\n- Added a new item: Moonsteel Wolf Armor\n- Compat with Paxels (Moonsteeel Paxel)\n- Compat with Commandly (VeinMining)\n- Adjusted particles\n# 🐝  BugFixes:\n- Moonsteel no longer depends on bta-backpack by proxy.\n\n## 🔽  Dependencies\n- BTA Babric >= 8.0.1: https://github.com/Turnip-Labs/babric-instance-repo/releases\n- HalpLibe >= 6.2.0+8.0.1: https://github.com/Turnip-Labs/bta-halplibe/releases\n\n## What's Changed\n* Updated MoonSteel to 8.0.1 by @Redart15 in https://github.com/UselessSolutions/moonmoonmoon/pull/4\n\n## New Contributors\n* @Redart15 made their first contribution in https://github.com/UselessSolutions/moonmoonmoon/pull/4\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/UselessSolutions/moonmoonmoon/compare/v1.1.0-7.3_03...v1.2.0+8.0.1"
